{"strongs": "H8462", "word": "תְּחִלָּה", "translit": "te.chil.lah", "root": "חלך", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "beginning", "definition": "תְּחִלָּה noun feminine beginning , הַתְּחִלָּה Neh 11:17 (read הַתְּחִלָּה ᵐ5 ᵑ9 SS Öttli ), בַּתְּחִלָּה Gen 13:3 + 10 t.; construct תְּחִלַּת Hos 1:2 ; Prov 9:10 ; Eccl 10:13 , בִּתְחִלַּת 2Kgs 17:25 + 4 t., תְ֯חִלַּת . 2Sam 21:9 , מִתְּחִלַּת 2Sam 21:10 : — construct with nouns חָכְמָה ׳ תּ Prov 9:10 the beginning, first principle of wisdom דִּבְרֵי ׳ תּ Eccl 10:13 the first word , followed by rel. clause ׳ דִּבֶּר י ׳ תּ at the beginning of, Yahweh spake (= when Yahweh first spake) Hos 1:2 preceded by preposition מִן 2Sam 21:10 , elsewhere by בְּ in the beginning , of the harvest Ruth 1:22 ; 2Sam 21:9 ( Qr ), of the kingdom Ezra 4:6 , of their dwelling there 2Kgs 17:25 , of supplications Dan 9:23 , of the shooting up of vegetation Amos 7:1 , ׳ כְּבַתְּ as in the beginning Isa 1:26 ׳ בַּתְּ at first, first in order Judg 1:1 ; Judg 20:18 (twice in verse); 2Sam 17:9 at the first, first (or former) time , i.e. first in a series of occurrences, Gen 13:3 ( J ), Gen 41:21 ( E ), Gen 43:18 ; Gen 43:20 ( J ), Dan 8:1 ; Dan 9:21 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2788')\">BDB2788</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8462')\">H8462</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2787')\">BDB2787</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2789')\">BDB2789</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תְּחִלָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>beginning</highlightword>, <bdbheb>הַתְּחִלָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,17)\">Neh 11:17</ref> (read <bdbheb>הַתְּחִלָּה</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"